        <activityName xml:lang="en">Gas turbine, 10MWe, at production plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Gas turbine, 10MWe, at production plant
Average gas turbine 10MWe.;
UUID: 098ea88a-716d-3420-88c9-76d9c4c41fcc
The module includes the most important materials used for construction. It includes also the energy requirements for construction; transport is implicitly included in energy consumption. (Life time for operation assumed 80"000 h.)
Location: Average conditions for European plants.
Technology: Average installed gas turbine. Estimate of energy per unit of material transferred from gas power plant.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Technology/Text
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_098ea88a-716d-3420-88c9-76d9c4c41fcc.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
